# EAS upload excludes.
#
# IMPORTANT: when this file exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore. So every heavy
# or local folder must be named here explicitly. PLACE AT THE WORKSPACE ROOT (next to
# pnpm-workspace.yaml). EAS reinstalls dependencies from the lockfile on its servers,
# so excluding the store and node_modules is correct — it does not break the build.

# --- Replit / local tooling stores (the pnpm store lives here — GIGABYTES) ---
.local/
.config/
.upm/
.cache/
**/.cache/
.pnpm-store/
**/.pnpm-store/
.expo/
**/.expo/
**/React Native DevTools*

# --- dependencies (EAS reinstalls from pnpm-lock.yaml) ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# --- build outputs (gitignored but NOT excluded by default — must be listed here) ---
# dist/ is the Expo/Metro build output and can be 300-400 MB — never upload it
dist/
**/dist/
web-build/
**/web-build/
static-build/
**/static-build/
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# --- vcs + large media not needed to build the app ---
.git/
attached_assets/
artifacts/api-server/
artifacts/mockup-sandbox/
artifacts/mobile/sfx-alternatives-preview.html

.DS_Store
